120	     * Maximum number of owners that may be registered on a single day. A create that would take the
121	     * number of owners sharing a {@code registrationDate} beyond this many - i.e. that many owners
122	     * have already been created that day - is rejected with a 429.
123	     */
124	    private static final int DAILY_OWNER_LIMIT = 100;
125	
